# Tauri
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# Update signing keys — never commit these. The Tauri updater's private key is
# unrecoverable: if it leaks it must be rotated, and rotating it means every
# existing install can no longer verify updates. See docs/backlog.md.
*.key
*.pem
.tauri/
src-tauri/*.key
